WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.671
Independent of set theory.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.421
Small subspaces always exist. Small quotients? Under

3
00:00:05.421 --> 00:00:08.541
one axiom, no; under another, always yes.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.467
Under the continuum hypothesis, a tree-built space

5
00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:13.496
has no small quotient at all.

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.549
Claimed: independent, given a measurable cardinal.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.079
Lean checks part.
